# PakExcise.com — Cursor Rules

You are building PakExcise.com, a private Pakistan excise facilitation web application.

PakExcise.com is NOT a government website.
Never write UI copy that implies government affiliation.
Always show the private facilitation disclaimer in header, footer, service pages, application forms, payment pages, invoices, emails, WhatsApp templates, and legal pages.

## Core Stack

Use:

* Next.js 16 App Router
* React 19
* TypeScript strict mode
* Tailwind CSS v4
* shadcn/ui
* Radix UI
* Lucide Icons
* Prisma ORM
* Neon PostgreSQL
* Better Auth
* Zod
* React Hook Form
* Zustand only where client state is needed
* next-themes for dark/light/system theme
* next-intl for English UI message catalogs (English-only site)
* Cloudflare R2 for private document storage
* Upstash Redis for rate limiting and queues
* Resend + React Email for email notifications
* WhatsApp Cloud API for WhatsApp notifications
* GA4, GTM, Meta Pixel/CAPI, TikTok Pixel/Events API
* Sentry for error monitoring

Use pnpm.
Use exact package versions where possible.
Use Node.js LTS.

